The '''NM Cartographer Skill-Capper''' is a low-micro PvE hero team for Normal Mode exploration, long-distance travel, and [[gww:Signet of Capture|elite-skill capture]] across all campaigns. A [[gww:Pious Renewal|Pious Renewal]] Dervish supplies mobile melee pressure while a P/Rt support hero maintains party speed and passive recovery. Three Air Elementalists provide armor-penetrating damage, Blind, Weakness, interrupts, and Cracked Armor; a smiting/channeling Monk amplifies the Dervish; and a two-Monk backline supplies healing, protection, party blocking, cleansing, and automatic resurrection.

The team deliberately trades the hard shutdown and energy battery of general-purpose Hard Mode meta teams for mobility, simple hero behavior, and a roster without primary Necromancer, Ritualist, or Mesmer heroes. It is intended for routine Normal Mode travel and short boss fights rather than difficult Hard Mode content.

